IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `lpula-practice`

-- Legal Profession Uniform Law Application Act 2022 (WA), with the Uniform Law (WA), Admission Rules and General Rules, admission and practice -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_legal-profession-uniform-law-application-act-2022_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-daniel/facts.json. Daniel's graduation (d023) and admission
-- (d031) came before 1 July 2022, under the repealed Legal Profession Act 2008; the life says the events are "replayed under
-- the Uniform Law", so the admission cases ask the Uniform Law's questions of his 2019-2020 facts, and the carry-over cases
-- ask what actually bridged him into the Law. Which form of PLT he did is an INFERENCE (a PLT course); renewal periods are
-- HYPOTHETICAL.

§ `fixtures`

`Daniel's Juris Doctor` MEANS `My law course` WITH
    `I completed it successfully` IS TRUE
    `a tertiary academic course in Australia` IS TRUE
    `years of full-time law study it equals` IS 3
    `accredited by the Board` IS TRUE
    `the Board determines it covers each Schedule 1 area` IS TRUE

`a two-year law diploma` MEANS `My law course` WITH
    `I completed it successfully` IS TRUE
    `a tertiary academic course in Australia` IS TRUE
    `years of full-time law study it equals` IS 2
    `accredited by the Board` IS TRUE
    `the Board determines it covers each Schedule 1 area` IS TRUE

`Daniel's PLT course` MEANS `My practical legal training` WITH
    `form` IS `a PLT course with an accredited provider`
    `I completed it successfully` IS TRUE
    `months of supervised legal training under an approved plan` IS 0
    `the Board determines the training plan is adequate` IS FALSE

`ten months of workplace training` MEANS `My practical legal training` WITH
    `form` IS `supervised legal training in a workplace`
    `I completed it successfully` IS TRUE
    `months of supervised legal training under an approved plan` IS 10
    `the Board determines the training plan is adequate` IS TRUE

`no PLT yet` MEANS `My practical legal training` WITH
    `form` IS `no PLT`
    `I completed it successfully` IS FALSE
    `months of supervised legal training under an approved plan` IS 0
    `the Board determines the training plan is adequate` IS FALSE

`Daniel's admission application` MEANS `My admission application` WITH
    `made in accordance with the local regulations` IS TRUE
    `made in accordance with the rules of court` IS TRUE
    `made in accordance with a practice direction` IS TRUE
    `a fee is prescribed` IS TRUE
    `I paid the prescribed fee` IS TRUE

`Daniel's certificate application` MEANS `My certificate application` WITH
    `in the local approved form, with its documents, fee and contributions` IS TRUE
    `I am an Australian lawyer` IS TRUE
    `I must have professional indemnity insurance` IS TRUE
    `I have or will have it` IS TRUE
    `I hold or have applied for another concurrent certificate` IS FALSE
    `the Board considers me not a fit and proper person` IS FALSE

`an application without insurance` MEANS `My certificate application` WITH
    `in the local approved form, with its documents, fee and contributions` IS TRUE
    `I am an Australian lawyer` IS TRUE
    `I must have professional indemnity insurance` IS TRUE
    `I have or will have it` IS FALSE
    `I hold or have applied for another concurrent certificate` IS FALSE
    `the Board considers me not a fit and proper person` IS FALSE

§ `ss 6, 7 -- which law governed each event (d031 24 Aug 2020, d038 4 Mar 2029)`

#ASSERT NOT `Does the Uniform Law govern my admission and practice on` (Date 24 8 2020)
#ASSERT `Does the Uniform Law govern my admission and practice on` (Date 4 3 2029)

§ `s 20 -- who decides`

#ASSERT `Who decides this for me` `my compliance certificate for admission` EQUALS `the Legal Practice Board`

§ `Admission Rules rr 5, 6, Sch 2 cl 4 -- d023: graduating and PLT, replayed under the Uniform Law`

#ASSERT `Have I attained the academic qualifications prerequisite` `Daniel's Juris Doctor` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Have I attained the academic qualifications prerequisite` `a two-year law diploma` FALSE

#ASSERT `Have I completed the practical legal training prerequisite` `Daniel's PLT course` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Have I completed the practical legal training prerequisite` `ten months of workplace training` FALSE

-- A PLT course not integrated with the degree, begun with two non-Schedule 1 subjects left, enrolled, with the Board's leave;
-- and workplace training begun before the law course is finished.
#ASSERT `May I start my PLT now` `a PLT course with an accredited provider` FALSE 2 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `May I start my PLT now` `supervised legal training in a workplace` FALSE 1 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE

-- Daniel applying in 2020 (months after the JD), and someone applying more than 5 years after it.
#ASSERT `Can the Board require more because my qualification is old` (Date 10 12 2019) (Date 11 12 2024)

§ `Uniform Law ss 17-19 -- the compliance certificate (d031)`

#ASSERT `Can the Board issue me a compliance certificate` `Daniel's Juris Doctor` FALSE `Daniel's PLT course` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Board may issue it to the Supreme Court`
#ASSERT `Can the Board issue me a compliance certificate` `Daniel's Juris Doctor` FALSE `no PLT yet` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `not yet: the practical legal training prerequisite is not met and I am not exempt`

§ `Uniform Law s 16, Application Act ss 113, 114 -- d031: admission by the Supreme Court`

#ASSERT `May the Supreme Court admit me` (Date 9 4 1996) (Date 24 8 2020) TRUE FALSE TRUE `Daniel's admission application` 3 EQUALS `the Supreme Court may admit me, subject to its inherent jurisdiction to refuse`
#ASSERT `May the Supreme Court admit me` (Date 9 4 1996) (Date 8 4 2014) TRUE FALSE TRUE `Daniel's admission application` 3 EQUALS `no: I am under 18`
#ASSERT `May the Supreme Court admit me` (Date 9 4 1996) (Date 24 8 2020) TRUE FALSE TRUE `Daniel's admission application` 2 EQUALS `no: the Court is not constituted by at least 3 judges`

#ASSERT `Does my old admission application continue` (Date 1 5 2022) FALSE

§ `Uniform Law Sch 4 cl 11, Application Act s 322 -- d031, d038: is Daniel an Australian lawyer`

#ASSERT `Am I an Australian lawyer` (Date 24 8 2020) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `a lawyer under the old Act: the Uniform Law did not yet apply`
#ASSERT `Am I an Australian lawyer` (Date 4 3 2029) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `an Australian lawyer under the Uniform Law (WA)`
#ASSERT `Am I an Australian lawyer` (Date 4 3 2029) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not admitted`

#ASSERT `What is my day of admission` (Date 24 8 2020) EQUALS (Date 24 8 2020)

§ `Uniform Law ss 44, 45, Sch 4 cl 12, General Rules rr 17, 18 -- d031: the practising certificate`

#ASSERT `Can I apply in WA for my practising certificate` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can I apply in WA for my practising certificate` FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT `Can the Board grant or renew my practising certificate` `Daniel's certificate application` EQUALS `the Board may grant or renew it`
#ASSERT `Can the Board grant or renew my practising certificate` `an application without insurance` EQUALS `no: I lack the professional indemnity insurance the Law requires`

-- His 2022-23 certificate, granted under the old Act before 1 July 2022 and operative from that day.
#ASSERT `Is my old certificate carried over` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `yes: it is taken to be an Australian practising certificate (Sch 4 cl 12(1))`

#ASSERT `Is my practising certificate in force on` (Date 24 8 2020) (Date 30 6 2021) FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my practising certificate in force on` (Date 24 8 2020) (Date 1 7 2021) FALSE TRUE FALSE

§ `Uniform Law ss 10, 43 -- d031: who may engage in legal practice`

-- d038: Daniel in 2029 with a current certificate.  d030: Daniel as a graduate at Swan & Partners before admission, advising a
-- client himself (replayed).  The same graduate drafting a policy submission.
#ASSERT `May I engage in legal practice` `give legal advice or other legal services` `an Australian lawyer under the Uniform Law (WA)` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `yes: as an Australian legal practitioner I am entitled to (Uniform Law s 43), subject to my certificate's conditions`
#ASSERT `May I engage in legal practice` `give legal advice or other legal services` `not admitted` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: it would be an offence under Uniform Law s 10(1), and I could keep no fee for it (s 10(2))`
#ASSERT `May I engage in legal practice` `policy work only` `not admitted` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `yes: policy work is not engaging in legal practice (Uniform Law s 6)`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for unqualified practice`  EQUALS 250

#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned for unqualified practice`  EQUALS 2

#ASSERT `Am I entitled to use the title` `solicitor` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Am I entitled to use the title` `lawyer` TRUE FALSE FALSE

§ `Uniform Law s 49, General Rules r 14, Application Act s 289 -- d031: supervised practice after admission`

#ASSERT `How many months of supervised legal practice must I complete` `other practical legal training, such as a PLT course` FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `How many months of supervised legal practice must I complete` `principally under the supervision of an Australian lawyer` FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS 18

-- From 24 Aug 2020 to 1 Jul 2022 (commencement day) Daniel had 22 full months; s 289(1) counts them under the Law.
#ASSERT `whole months from` (Date 24 8 2020) (Date 1 7 2022) EQUALS 22

#ASSERT `Must I still engage in supervised legal practice only` 24 22
#ASSERT NOT `Must I still engage in supervised legal practice only` 24 102

#ASSERT `Is my work supervised legal practice` TRUE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `May I supervise other lawyers` TRUE FALSE

