#ASSERT `Will the Board accept my renewal` (Date 15 5 2029) (Date 1 4 2029) (Date 31 5 2029) (Date 30 6 2029) EQUALS `in time: made in the standard renewal period`
#ASSERT `Will the Board accept my renewal` (Date 15 12 2029) (Date 1 4 2029) (Date 31 5 2029) (Date 30 6 2029) EQUALS `very late: the Board may accept it only if satisfied the delay was beyond my control or other circumstances warrant it`
#ASSERT `Will the Board accept my renewal` (Date 1 1 2030) (Date 1 4 2029) (Date 31 5 2029) (Date 30 6 2029) EQUALS `the Board must reject it`

